  "complexity": 5,
  "title": "Demo residue cleanup: no default expert name, preview/fixture/__audit routes 404 in production, caps documented",
  "spec": "Why: roadmap 1.2 and P0-12. The expert name defaults to \"Sabine\" (src/components/capture/CaptureApp.tsx:116,223), so the demo persona leaks into real sessions; the fixture, preview and __audit routes (src/app/*/preview, src/app/(app)/preview, src/app/__audit, src/lib/fixtures) are local-mode only but still part of the production bundle; production usage caps were raised for the demo (code defaults in src/lib/usage/index.ts are the intended values).\nWhat:\n1. CaptureApp: initial expert state \"\" ; starting a capture without a non-empty expert name is blocked with an inline \"Who is the expert?\" prompt (field focused, start disabled), no fallback name anywhere in the capture start path. Agents' expert_name prefills the field when present. Tests.\n2. Preview, fixture and __audit routes: one helper `src/lib/fixtures/enabled.ts` `fixturesEnabled()` = appMode is local AND NODE_ENV !== \"production\"; every preview/__audit page and the (app)/preview shell call `notFound()` when it is false (import at module top so tree-shaking keeps the bundle small; do not delete the routes). Add a guard test that enumerates src/app/**/preview/** and src/app/__audit/** pages and asserts each imports fixturesEnabled and calls notFound.\n3. e2e/ specs that visit preview routes keep working in local mode (they run with appMode local); if any e2e asserts a preview route in production mode, update it.\n4. docs/checks/demo-cleanup.md: the production checks (every /preview and /__audit URL answers 404 in production; capture without a name asks for one) and the USAGE_CAP_* defaults (vision 3000, decide 2000, workmap 50, voice 60 per workspace per day as in DEFAULT_CAPS) with the note that the Vercel env still carries the demo values and the human resets them (P0-6).\nKeep the general positioning: no industry-specific example text added. Do not touch README.md, docs/DEPLOY.md, .env.example, src/lib/perception/**, src/app/api/vision/** (capture task owns them).",
  "inputs": [],
  "acceptance": [
    "CaptureApp has no 'Sabine' default: starting without an expert name is blocked with an inline prompt (component test), expert_name from the agent prefills (test)",
    "fixturesEnabled() is false when NODE_ENV is production or appMode is not local; every page under src/app/**/preview/** and src/app/__audit/** returns notFound() when it is false (guard test enumerates the files)",
    "npm run e2e specs still pass in local mode for the preview routes they visit (state the run or why not run)",
    "docs/checks/demo-cleanup.md written with the 404 checks and the DEFAULT_CAPS values; README.md, docs/DEPLOY.md, .env.example untouched",
    ".claude/hooks/tests-green.sh wt/THIS-TASK exits 0"
  ],
  "scope": [
